  "summary_en": "State Council Decree No. 823 promulgating the Regulations on Promoting National Reading, effective 1 February 2026. It sets responsibilities for publishing authorities, reading facilities, funding, support for children, rural areas, disabled and elderly readers, and liabilities. Unrelated to AI or robotics.",
